   "text": "Cloud never binds local Codex or Claude Code.\nThe embedding model and dimensions must\nmatch the published index.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Cloud never binds local Codex or Claude Code.\nThe embedding model and dimensions must\nmatch the published index.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.35
  },
  {
   "id": "aYSIeDxIW3r3gGyUPCWK4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 10,
   "y": 725,
   "width": 1090.158203125,
   "height": 45.900000000000006,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "ai",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 275447803,
   "version": 2,
   "versionNonce": 199105397,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1794389070279,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Figure 8. Deployment. Locally everything runs in one Compose stack and your own agent reaches it over MCP. The cloud demo splits a 4-core / 8 GB CPU box\n(web, API, MySQL, Elasticsearch, Redis on a private network) from a GPU box that serves query embeddings and transcription over HTTPS.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Figure 8. Deployment. Locally everything runs in one Compose stack and your own agent reaches it over MCP. The cloud demo splits a 4-core / 8 GB CPU box\n(web, API, MySQL, Elasticsearch, Redis on a private network) from a GPU box that serves query embeddings and transcription over HTTPS.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.35
  },
